{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself in competitive tournaments, sharpen your technique in practice mode, or challenge players worldwide in thrilling online duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision. Nerves. Flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ski Jumping World Cup - where every jump matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >** Features**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Global Arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on meticulously designed hills inspired by real-world ski jumping venues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Deep, Skill-Based Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the takeoff, flight, and landing phases with physics that reward timing and consistency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy quick matches, classic 4-hill tournaments, full World Cup seasons, or practice at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players worldwide in ranked competitions and climb the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hot-Seat Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends on a single device and prove who\u2019s the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Day &amp; Night Competitions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on your favorite hills in both daylight and spectacular night events under floodlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive Atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, realistic wind conditions, and detailed visuals recreate the intensity and beauty of ski jumping.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985400?t=1760437108","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985400?t=1760437108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/9ae9f505dec0ba4b0d3e9d01e6f2e086f2412676/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760437108","capsule_imagev5"